<title>INDIA: India's RBI gives repo auctions calendar for June.</title>
<headline>India's RBI gives repo auctions calendar for June.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Thursday announced the schedule for securities repurchase auctions in June.</p>
<p>The repo auctions will be open to parties holding SGL account and current account with the RBI.</p>
<p>The following are the details of the auction.</p>
<p>Date of auction  Date of payment   Period  Repurchase date</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>June  2, 1997     June  3, 1997	3 days    June  6, 1997</p>
<p>June  5, 1997     June  6, 1997	4 days    June 10, 1997</p>
<p>June  9, 1997     June 10, 1997	3 days    June 13, 1997</p>
<p>June 12, 1997     June 13, 1997	4 days    June 17, 1997</p>
<p>June 16, 1997     June 17, 1997	3 days    June 20, 1997</p>
<p>June 19, 1997     June 20, 1997	4 days    June 24, 1997</p>
<p>June 23, 1997     June 24, 1997	4 days    June 28, 1997</p>
<p>June 27, 1997     June 28, 1997	4 days    June 2, 1997</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
